source: tests/ui.rs
expression: "screen_text(&mut r.app, 100, 30)"
---
vitals [1 cpu] [2 mem] [3 disk] [4 net] [5 tokens] [6 claude]   1s 12:00 [▤ bars] [⣿ graphs] [⚙] [?]
┌ CP┌─vitals help──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐5%─┐
│all│  CPU   Memory   Disk   Network   Tokens   Claude   Controls                              │75%│
│0  │                                                                                          │   │
│2  │ Timeline                                                                                 │   │
│4  │   The mean busy percent of all threads over the time window (2 minutes by default;       │   │
│6  │   scroll over the timeline or press + and - to change it).                               │   │
│8  │                                                                                          │   │
│10 │ Bars                                                                                     │   │
│12 │ all                                                                                      │   │
│14 │   How busy the CPU is on average: the mean of the thread percents.                       │   │
└───│   source  /proc/stat, the cpuN lines, fields 1-8; busy = total - (idle + iowait)         │───┘
┌ Di│   unit    percent                                                                        │/s─┐
│/  │   scale   100% means every thread was busy for the whole refresh interval                │   │
│/tm│ 0, 1, 2 ...                                                                              │   │
│nvm│   One bar per hardware thread, as many columns as fit (a bar is at least 8 cells wide).  │   │
│rea│   Hidden with per_thread = false.                                                        │   │
│wri│   source  /proc/stat, the cpuN line of that thread                                       │   │
│   │   unit    percent                                                                        │   │
│   │   scale   100% means that thread was busy the whole interval                             │   │
└───│                                                                                          │───┘
┌ To│ Summary line                                                                             │in─┐
│inp│ frequency                                                                                │min│
│out│   The average clock speed over all cores.                                                │min│
│cac│   source  /sys/devices/system/cpu/cpufreq/policy*/scaling_cur_freq                       │min│
│cac│   unit    GHz                                                                            │min│
└───│   scale   not a bar: the current value                                                   │───┘
┌ Cl│ ←→ tab · ↑↓ PgUp PgDn scroll · Esc closes                                           1/16 │1%─┐
│5 H└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘   │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
